-- Lesson 10. Teaching the language your own words.

please define greet with a name:
    give back "Hello, {name}."
thank you for defining

please show greet with "Ada"

-- Two values are separated by `and`.
please define greet warmly with a name and a greeting:
    give back "{greeting}, {name}!"
thanks

please show greet warmly with "Ada" and "Good morning"

-- An action's name can be several words long, which often reads better.
-- An action may call itself, as this one does.
please define count down from with a number:
    check if number is at most 0:
        give back "done"
    thanks
    show number
    give back count down from with number minus 1
thanks

please show count down from with 3

-- And you may use an action before you have defined it: the whole file is
-- read first.
please show doubled with 21

please define doubled with a number:
    give back number times 2
thanks
